# Source CSVs are too large for git (~4 GB total). Don't commit them.
# To rebuild the parquet locally, drop fresh files in here per README.md.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# EXCEPTION: the closed-enforcement export (~23 KB) is the one input with no
# download step — it's a manual export from FMCSA's portal, so a fresh checkout
# (a CI runner) has no way to obtain it and add_enforcement.py is not optional.
# Committing it is what makes an unattended refresh possible at all. It is
# public FMCSA data. Refresh it per data/sources/README.md; the filename carries
# its export date, so a newer export needs FMCSA_ENFORCEMENT_XLSX in build_all
# repointed at it.
!closed_enforcement_cases_*.xlsx
